International-transfer note

No vendor list, hosting region, support-access location, model endpoint, or transfer mechanism is evidenced. Before any EEA personal data is sent outside the EEA, the controller must identify the transfer route and document an adequacy decision or appropriate safeguard such as the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses, together with the required transfer assessment and supplementary measures where needed. The same review applies to remote access and subprocessors, not only server location.

