Who is the production controller, who operates Intellectus, and may the builders/vendors reuse inputs, outputs, or logs for analytics or model training?

Determines Articles 5, 6, 24 and 28 role allocation, lawful basis, compatible purpose, and DPA scope.

The client is controller; the operator is processor; all own-purpose reuse and training are prohibited unless separately assessed and disclosed.

