Can users enter person-level or confidential data, and can research collect or infer special-category or criminal-conviction data about staff, donors, partners, or beneficiaries?

Determines minimisation, Article 9/10 conditions, notice content, DPIA need, and whether a deny/filter rule is required.

Person-level data can enter through free text and public research; sensitive data is possible but not intended.

Pending written response

