What are the retention/deletion periods for n8n executions, source snapshots, model-provider logs, gateway logs, backups, run IDs, and browser state, and how will access/erasure/objection requests be fulfilled?

Required for Articles 5(1)(e), 12–22, 25, 30 and 32.

Browser data is session-only, but upstream retention and rights procedures are undefined.

Pending written response

