At what scale and for what decisions will the outputs be used—conversation preparation only, or grants, benefits, employment, eligibility, service access, or evaluation of individuals?

Affects purpose limitation, DPIA criteria, fairness, and Article 22; consequential person-level use changes the risk profile.

Use is limited to organisation-level consulting preparation with meaningful human review and no solely automated significant decision.

